<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεισ-φέρω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οίσω</span>
		 and <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήνεγκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					50.8
				</span></i>
			:—<i>advance money to pay the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσθορά</span>”
				<i>for others,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					42.25
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				50.8
			</span></i>; generally, <i>advance money to the State</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				344.115
			</span></i> (Teos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον ἄτοκον π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(4).1055.11
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>introduce</i> a law <i>before,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.166
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				39.3
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>introduce before</i> (in writing), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				321
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>confer previously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν τῇ πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					22.27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				12.37
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
